WEBVTT

00:17:56.947 --> 00:18:00.700
Yeah, so it's a kind of very,

00:18:00.742 --> 00:18:06.581
very good point to think
about the future impacts of all actions

00:18:06.581 --> 00:18:10.252
and the impact particularly on,
as you say, children and grandchildren.

00:18:11.002 --> 00:18:14.714
VN: Yeah, I believe that all life
on Earth is sacred,

00:18:14.756 --> 00:18:18.426
and I believe that there is
an intersection,

00:18:18.426 --> 00:18:22.097
or interconnection of all life
on the planet.

00:18:22.097 --> 00:18:24.474
And just to really add on that,

00:18:24.474 --> 00:18:28.061
in my tribe, I am a Muganda by tribe,

00:18:28.061 --> 00:18:30.063
we have different clans.